msgctxt "L_ARK_009"
msgid "Access foyer elevator\\n"
msgstr "Accéder à l'ascenseur du hall\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_010"
msgid "Reactivate office elevator\\n"
msgstr "Réactiver l'ascenseur du bureau\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_011"
msgid "Destroy dataDyne hovercopter\\n"
msgstr "Détruire l'hovercopter dataDyne\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_012"
msgid "Defeat Cassandra's bodyguards\\n"
msgstr "Battre les gardes de Cassandra\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_013"
msgid "Rendezvous at helipad\\n"
msgstr "Retour à l'héliport avec Dr. Caroll\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_014"
msgid "Accessing elevator controls...\\n"
msgstr "Accès paramètres ascenseur...\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_015"
msgid "LIGHTS ARE NOW ON!\\n"
msgstr "LUMIERES ON\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_016"
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been killed!\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll abattu!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_017"
msgid "Dr. Caroll is under attack!\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll sous feu ennemi!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_018"
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been damaged!\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll endommagé!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_019"
msgid "Too late! She's here...\\n"
msgstr "Trop tard! La voici...\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_020"
msgid "You've become quite an annoyance...\\n"
msgstr "Vous êtes une sacrée peste, vous...\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_021"
msgid "Good night, Ms. Dark.\\n"
msgstr "Bonne nuit, Miss Dark.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_022"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW ON\\n"
msgstr "LUMIERES ON\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_023"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW OFF\\n"
msgstr "LUMIERES OFF\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_024"
msgid "MISSION FAILED\\n"
msgstr "MISSION ECHOUEE\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_025"
msgid "MISSION SUCCESSFUL\\n"
msgstr "MISSION ACCOMPLIE\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_026"
msgid "Helichopper warning goes here.\\n"
msgstr "Emplacement pour warning hélico.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_027"
msgid "Obtain Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir Vue nocturne.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_028"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries: \\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_029"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_030"
msgid "Night Vision\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_031"
msgid "Picked up Night Vision.\\n"
msgstr "Vue nocturne obtenue.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_032"
msgid "We meet again, girl!\\n"
msgstr "Re-bonjour, jeune fille!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_033"
msgid "Foyer elevator accessed.\\n"
msgstr "Ascenseur hall atteint.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_034"
msgid "Office elevator door has been unlocked.\\n"
msgstr "Porte ascenseur bureau ouverte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_035"
msgid "DataDyne Hovercopter eliminated.\\n"
msgstr "Hovercopter dataDyne éliminé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_036"
msgid "Cassandra's bodyguards have been defeated.\\n"
msgstr "Gardes de Cassandra vaincus.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_037"
msgid "That's not how it goes.\\n"
msgstr "Mais...pas comme ça!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_038"
msgid "Yes, it is.\\n"
msgstr "Mais si.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_039"
msgid "Give it to me - you're doing it wrong.\\n"
msgstr "Vous faites n'importe quoi!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_040"
msgid "Stop annoying me.\\n"
msgstr "Silence.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_041"
msgid "Will you just hurry up!\\n"
msgstr "Mais dépêchez-vous!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_042"
msgid "Oh, no...too late.\\n"
msgstr "Oh, non...trop tard.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_043"
msgid "She's here...\\n"
msgstr "La voilà...\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_044"
msgid "Get her!\\n"
msgstr "Attrapez-la!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_045"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed. \\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit. \\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_046"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir CamSpy.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_047"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll: \\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_048"
msgid "CamSpy\\n"
msgstr "CamSpy\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_049"
msgid "A CamSpy\\n"
msgstr "Une CamSpy\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_050"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "CamSpy obtenue.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_051"
msgid "They've locked down the ground floor - \\nget to the elevator!\\n"
msgstr "Ils ont verrouillé le rez-de-chaussée - \\nallez à l'ascenseur!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_052"
msgid "That copter needs to be taken out, or \\nthe jumpship'll get shot down!\\n"
msgstr "Il faut détruire cet hélico ou le \\ntransport sera descendu!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_053"
msgid "I can't leave any bodyguards standing.\\n"
msgstr "Je ne peux laisser un garde du corps vivant.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_054"
msgid "Don't keep the jumpship waiting - \\nget back to the landing pad.\\n"
msgstr "Ne faites attendre le transport - \\nretournez à l'héliport.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_055"
msgid "Obtain alpha key card.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir la carte alpha.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_056"
msgid "Guard's\\n"
msgstr "Garde: \\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_057"
msgid "Office key card\\n"
msgstr "Carte de bureau\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_058"
msgid "Office key card\\n"
msgstr "Carte du bureau\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_059"
msgid "Picked up Cassandra's office key card.\\n"
msgstr "Carte de bureau de Cassandra obtenue.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_060"
msgid "Sound the alarm - she's here!\\n"
msgstr "Alerte! Elle est ici!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_061"
msgid "Lights out!\\n"
msgstr "Bonne nuit!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_062"
msgid "What the...?\\n"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu...?\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_063"
msgid "Going somewhere?\\n"
msgstr "On se balade?\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_064"
msgid "Something I can do for you, old woman?\\n"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'elle veut mère-grand?\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_065"
msgid "Return our sapient immediately! You don't \\nknow what you're doing.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Remettez-moi le sapiens immédiatement! Vous ne \\nsavez pas ce que vous "
"faites...\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_066"
msgid "Yes I do. I'm leaving.\\n"
msgstr "Oh que si. Je rentre chez moi.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_067"
msgid "One more chance! Give it back, and you \\ncould come and work for me.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour la dernière fois: rendez ce qui \\nm'appartient et je vous offre un "
"poste.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_068"
msgid "Sorry! Gotta shoot.\\n"
msgstr "Désolée! Je me tire.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_069"
msgid "You must get the sapient back. We cannot \\nproceed without it.\\n"
msgstr "Il nous faut le sapiens. Le reste de \\nl'opération en dépend.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_070"
msgid "I know that!\\n"
msgstr "J'en suis consciente!\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_071"
msgid "I also know who to talk to... \\nMr. Carrington.\\n"
msgstr "Je sais aussi à qui m'adresser...\\nMr. Carrington.\\n"

msgctxt "L_ARK_072"
msgid "Elevator door is inactive on this floor.\\n"
msgstr "Porte d'ascenseur inutilisable à cet étage.\\n"
